msgstr "Yes. ChatGPT makes flashcards you can flip, shuffle and mark as known. It doesn’t decide when you see each card again. Connect Lymi and the cards go to your decks, where spaced repetition schedules each one: cards you remember come back later, the ones you forget sooner."

