msgstr "Yes. Claude writes good flashcards and can even build a quiz in an artifact. It has no deck that brings cards back on a schedule, so they stay in that chat. Connect Lymi and Claude adds them to your decks, where spaced repetition schedules each one: cards you remember come back later, the ones you forget sooner."

